Package: uthyagent
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: uthyagent contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: xdotool, libsecret-tools, at-spi2-core, tesseract-ocr, gnome-screenshot
Description: alpha Linux-first Python/GTK4 desktop computer-use assistant
 UthyAgent is an early-alpha Linux-first Python/GTK4 desktop application.
 .
 X11 automation is best-effort and requires local desktop tools. General
 Wayland input automation is not implemented. Telegram, MCP, and voice
 integrations are not included in this alpha.
